## Platooning Algorithms

### String Stability Analysis

**Objective:** Ensure disturbances don't amplify upstream in a platoon.

**Transfer Function (Frequency Domain):**
```
H(jω) = |x_i(jω) / x_{i-1}(jω)|

String stable if: |H(jω)| ≤ 1 for all ω
```

